{{!
    Overrides the go generator's built-in go.mod.mustache, passed as
    -t templates/go.

    Generator 7.10.0 imports gopkg.in/validator.v2 from every oneOf model but
    leaves it out of go.mod, and the built-in output does not compile. Change
    the pinned version here and in go.sum.mustache together.

    The go directive is the oldest Go consumers can build with. go-sdk-tests.yml
    tests that version and the current stable release.
}}
module {{gitHost}}/{{gitUserId}}/{{gitRepoId}}

go 1.22

require gopkg.in/validator.v2 v2.0.1
